message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Geometry-Driven Renormalization of Elastic Fluctuations in Constrained Hydrogel Microfluidics"
abstract: >
  Confinement fundamentally alters the elastic behavior of soft matter systems.
  The CEIT framework introduces geometry as a renormalization field for elasticity,
  validated by hydrogel microfluidics experiments and FRG analysis.
